<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Financial Affidavit</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .logo { float: right; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .signature-line { height: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>2021-2022 Financial Affidavit for Undergraduate International Students</h1>
    <div class="logo">
      <!-- Placeholder for PACE University Logo -->
      <span style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold;">PACE UNIVERSITY</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="clear: both;"></div>

  <div class="section-title">Office of Undergraduate Admission</div>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <strong>One Pace Plaza</strong><br>
        New York, NY 10083 USA<br>
        Phone: (212) 346-1323<br>
        Fax: (212) 346-1040<br>
        Email: <span data-field="office_email">{{ office_email }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <strong>861 Bedford Road</strong><br>
        Pleasantville, NY 10570 USA<br>
        Phone: (914) 773-3746<br>
        Fax: (914) 773-3851<br>
        Email: <span data-field="office_email_2">{{ office_email_2 }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">This Financial Affidavit for International Students is for use by Pace University International students who require a Certificate of Eligibility for a student visa. The completed affidavit must be submitted with a letter from a bank indicating the availability of sufficient funds in US dollars for one year of study.</p>
  <p>Applicants are advised to obtain a second set of bank documents for use by the embassy issuing your student visa.</p>
  <p>If financial support will be provided by one or more sponsors, please note that each sponsor must submit a separate Sponsor Affidavit of Support and bank documentation verifying the availability of funds. The Sponsor Affidavit of Support is on the reverse side of this page and may be reproduced.</p>

  <p>I certify that I have <span data-field="certification_statement">{{ certification_statement }}</span>.</p>

  <p>I have indicated the source of my financial support below and have attached original bank documentation in US dollars. The information I have provided on this affidavit is true and correct to the best of my knowledge and belief. I know that any false statement on this affidavit will result in the cancellation of my admission to Pace University. I also understand that the entire tuition and general institution fees is due at the time of registration for each term, that the insurance cost is an annual fee, and that costs may rise in succeeding terms. I also understand that if I am required to enroll for English Language course-work, additional costs will ensue.</p>

  <div class="section-title">PACE UNIVERSITY UNDERGRADUATE STUDY</div>
  <div class="section-title">School of Performing Arts</div>
  <p>Estimated Expenses for the 2021-2022 Academic Year</p>

  <table style="width: 60%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Estimated Tuition (24-36 credits)</td>
      <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right;"><span data-field="estimated_tuition_amount">{{ estimated_tuition_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Standard Fees</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="standard_fees_amount">{{ standard_fees_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Health and Accident Insurance (12 months)</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="insurance_amount">{{ insurance_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Books and Supplies</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="books_supplies_amount">{{ books_supplies_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Personal Expenses</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="personal_expenses_amount">{{ personal_expenses_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Room and Board</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="room_board_amount">{{ room_board_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Total:</strong></td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><strong><span data-field="total_expenses">{{ total_expenses }}</span></strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Pace Scholarship (subtracted from total)</td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="scholarship_amount">{{ scholarship_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Total Expenses after Scholarship:</strong></td>
      <td style="text-align: right;"><strong><span data-field="final_total_expenses">{{ final_total_expenses }}</span></strong></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 50px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Student Signature</td>
      <td style="width: 25%; text-align: center;">Month/Day/Year</td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Print Name</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Print Current Address</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Print Permanent Foreign Address</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33.33%;">Telephone Number</td>
      <td style="width: 33.33%;">Fax Number</td>
      <td style="width: 33.33%;">Email Address</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 40px; font-size: 0.9em;">* Standard fees include the General Institution fee, Student Activities fee, Technology fee, and Health Care Service fee.</p>
</div>

